{#
  The creative book as markdown — the source of truth for the PDF (Stage 04
  PRD §14). `creative_book.html.jinja` renders the same context, the same
  sections in the same order; `test_creative_book` compares their headings.

  - Never put a judgement in here. Every status, verdict and count arrives in
    the context from the package; a conditional that changes one is a node
    change wearing a template's clothes.
  - The draft watermark is not decoration. §14: "a draft that can be imported
    into Google Ads Editor is the most dangerous artifact this stage could
    produce" — a draft book must not pass for the released one either.
  - Block tags sit on lines of their own (`trim_blocks` eats the newline after
    one); `normalise` collapses the blank lines that leaves.
#}
